女真可愛！\n想請您畫一張Chobits的小唧。\n\n【場景】\n小唧穿着婚紗與秀樹做愛。\n\n【服裝】\n粉紅髮飾（原作）、婚紗頭巾、婚紗頸飾、婚紗頭飾（花或冠）、白色長手套（不露指）、婚戒、白色高跟鞋（雙腳都穿着）。\n婚紗禮服半脫或全脫都無所謂，但上面的物品需要有。\n不需要絲袜。\n\n【姿勢】\n小唧張開雙腿，露出私處。\n體位由老師決定。請選一個能看到小唧較多肌膚的體位。\n需要看到小唧全身，包括高跟鞋。不介意人物畫得小一點。\n\n【竿役】\n秀樹。\n他的雞雞需要出現。\n他的臉是否出現無所謂。（假如出現，請畫出與原作一樣的髮型。）\n\n【差分】\n私處：正常私處、私處被雞雞插入、私處被中出、私處流出精液。\n表情：微笑、睜一眼閉一眼（剛被插入）、心形瞳孔（高潮＋餘韻）。\n\n【細節】\n假如男主的臉出現在圖中，小唧望向男主。（避免出現第三者視角）\n假如男主的臉不在圖中，小唧望向鏡頭。\n\n謝謝Hitsuki老師，期待成品。", "nc": 56, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Hitsuki_FunDraw/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1220484, "client_id": 629526, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a03bec08/uploads/origins/be2c3555-9fb6-48f4-8f91-15680af1d42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a17425a698ed8827890207f60860b8e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a03bec08/uploads/origins/be2c3555-9fb6-48f4-8f91-15680af1d42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a17425a698ed8827890207f60860b8e, https://si.imgix.net/a03bec08/uploads/origins/be2c3555-9fb6-48f4-8f91-15680af1d42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d58354f4269c9748dc0826ce135f74f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a03bec08/uploads/origins/be2c3555-9fb6-48f4-8f91-15680af1d42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02c8246e65ac677db7e738a575c23aff 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a03bec08/uploads/origins/be2c3555-9fb6-48f4-8f91-15680af1d42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9f8f470b50e161417ca3f2c5904d931b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a03bec08/uploads/origins/be2c3555-9fb6-48f4-8f91-15680af1d42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blu